---
const footerLinks = [
  {
    title: "Servicios Principales",
    links: [
      { href: "/licencia-de-enfermeria-y-examen-nclex-usa/", label: "Licencia RN y Examen NCLEX" },
      { href: "/evaluacion-y-homologacion-de-titulo-enfermeria-usa/", label: "Homologación CGFNS / TruMerit" },
      { href: "/ofertas-de-empleo-para-enfermeras-en-usa/", label: "Ofertas Laborales con Sponsor" },
      { href: "/proceso-de-visa-y-relocalizacion-para-enfermeras/", label: "Visa EB-3 y Green Card" },
      { href: "/salarios-de-enfermeros-en-estados-unidos/", label: "Salarios 2026 por Estado" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Recursos & Blog",
    links: [
      { href: "/blog/home/", label: "Blog RNNCLEX" },
      { href: "/licencia-de-enfermeria-y-examen-nclex-usa/", label: "Guía Definitiva NCLEX" },
      { href: "/salarios-de-enfermeros-en-estados-unidos/", label: "Calculadora de Salarios" },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Redes Oficiales & Contacto",
    links: [
      { href: "mailto:soporte@rnnclex.com", label: "✉️ soporte@rnnclex.com", isEmail: true },
      { href: "https://www.youtube.com/@rnnclex", label: "▶️ YouTube Oficial", external: true },
      { href: "https://www.instagram.com/rnnclex", label: "📸 Instagram Oficial", external: true },
      { href: "https://www.facebook.com/rnnclex", label: "👍 Facebook Oficial", external: true },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer class="bg-gray-900 text-white mt-16 py-12 border-t border-gray-800">
  <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-4">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-wider">RN<span class="text-emerald-500">NCLEX</span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          La plataforma #1 para enfermeros hispanos. Te preparamos para el examen NCLEX-RN y te acompañamos desde la homologación de tu título hasta tu contrato en EE.UU.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@rnnclex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-800 hover:bg-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs transition" title="YouTube">▶️</a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rnnclex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-800 hover:bg-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs transition" title="Instagram">📸</a>
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/rnnclex" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-800 hover:bg-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xs transition" title="Facebook">👍</a>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://bit.ly/3R6RbFW"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-block bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded shadow transition-all"
        >
          Agendar Sesión Informativa
        </a>
      </div>

      {footerLinks.map((col) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-4 text-base tracking-wide">{col.title}</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            {col.links.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={link.href}
                  target={link.external ? "_blank" : "_self"}
                  rel={link.external ? "noopener noreferrer" : ""}
                  class="text-gray-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors"
                >
                  {link.isEmail ? <Fragment set:html="<!--email_off-->✉️ soporte@rnnclex.com<!--/email_off-->" /> : link.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 gap-4">
      <p>© 2026 rnnclex.com — Plataforma de Preparación NCLEX y Homologación para Enfermeros Hispanos. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-gray-300">Inicio</a>
        <a href="/blog/home/" class="hover:text-gray-300">Blog</a>
        <a href="mailto:soporte@rnnclex.com" class="hover:text-gray-300"><Fragment set:html="<!--email_off-->soporte@rnnclex.com<!--/email_off-->" /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
